SET "Configuration" = '{"family":"IndividualPhone","taxonomyLeaf":"IndividualPhone","wsdlDataObjectTypeCount":4,"wsdlDataObjectTypeVariants":["IndividualPhone_Phone_XRef_DataObjectType","IndividualPhone_Customer_DataObjectType","IndividualPhone_Phone_DataObjectType","IndividualPhone_Country_DataObjectType"],"queryRoot":"IndividualPhone","transport":"SOAP/XML xWeb (netForumXML.asmx)","soapEndpoint":"/xweb/secure/netForumXML.asmx","soapNamespace":"http://www.avectra.com/2005/","getOperation":"WEBPhoneGet","readSoapAction":"http://www.avectra.com/2005/WEBPhoneGet","accessPath":{"door":"GetQuery","queryObject":"IndividualPhone","nestingPath":[],"doorArgs":{"szObjectName":"IndividualPhone","topModifier":"@TOP -1"},"note":"Reached via GetQuery(szObjectName=IndividualPhone) which flattens the joined relational tables into a single row set; the 4 IndividualPhone_* DataObjectType variants are field-groupings/view-variants of this one entity (unioned into this IO''s fields). FacadeObject (GetFacadeObject/szObjectName) is the per-record CRUD path; WEB* ops where present."},"syncStrategy":"WatermarkIncremental","contentHashApplicable":false,"stableOrderingKey":"cph_key","columnList":["cph_key","cph_change_date"],"columnListNote":"Declared from a live probe of nfdev.plusweb.org on 2026-09-15: with an EMPTY szColumnList this object faults \"''*'' is not a valid value for szColumnList\" — its default list is itself ''*'' on that tenant — so without a declared list it cannot be read at all. Primary key + watermark only, the two columns the connector needs; accepted by the door (0 row(s)). Extend with proven column names when a tenant needs more.","isMutable":true,"writeOps":{"createOp":"WEBPhoneInsert","updateOp":"WEBPhoneUpdate"},"createSoapAction":"http://www.avectra.com/2005/WEBPhoneInsert","updateSoapAction":"http://www.avectra.com/2005/WEBPhoneUpdate"}'
